bluejetty:00090248:ios.description:
An all-in-one local media & file manager, centralize all your local videos, audio, documents, images and ZIP archives. Equipped with file transfer, privacy encryption, format converter and QR scanner to organize local files effortlessly.
Core Features
● Local Video Player: Offline files only. Supports MP4, MOV, MKV, AVI, FLV, M2TS, M4V, TS, VOB, WMV, MPEG and more mainstream formats;
● Local Audio Player: Full format support including MP3, FLAC, APE, AAC, OGG, WAV, WMA for lossless local music playback;
● Document Viewer: Open PDF, Word, TXT, HTML, PPT, Numbers, Pages, Keynote office files;
● Privacy Protection: Fingerprint / gesture lock, file encryption & decryption for private data;
● Local image browsing & editing;
● Archive tools: ZIP compression; extraction supports ZIP, RAR, 7Z, TAR, TAR.GZ, TAR.BZ2, GZ, BZ2 (incl. password-protected archives);
● Multi-way file transfer: Wi-Fi LAN transfer, iTunes wired transfer, device-to-device sharing;
● Local audio & video format converter;
● QR & barcode scanner, QR code generator;
● Playback history, incognito local playback, custom skip intro/outro for media files;
● Markdown preview & editing support.
All core features above are available for free users. Subscribe to unlock all premium perks, remove in-app ads and access batch encryption, incognito playback and other advanced tools.
Auto-Renewable Membership Terms
Auto-renew subscriptions: Monthly $0.99 / Month, Yearly $6.99 / Year
Lifetime one-time purchase: $17.99. One single payment for permanent full premium access, no recurring charges.
Subscription Rules
Payment will be charged to your Apple Account upon purchase confirmation. Subscriptions auto-renew, and renewal fees will be charged 24 hours prior to the end of each billing cycle.
To turn off auto-renewal, go to [Settings > Apple Account > Subscriptions] at least 24 hours before your current period expires. Your membership access remains active until the end of the paid billing cycle after cancellation.
If you reinstall the app or switch devices, log in with your original purchase Apple ID and tap [Restore Purchase] to recover your membership at no extra cost.
Support & Legal Links
For billing issues, missing premium access or function errors, visit our official support page or email us: xiaodeve@163.com
Terms of Use: https://xiaodev.com.cn/terms.html
Privacy Policy: https://xiaodev.com.cn/privacy.html
App Support Page: https://xiaodev.com.cn/support.html
This app only processes locally stored files and provides offline media & file management functions solely.
Report bugs or compatibility issues via email: xiaodeve@163.com.

